  "description": "Pinned BERT-family text embeddings and paired-input reranking on ONNX Runtime CPU (fp32), with owned tokenization (Starlings.Tokenizers: WordPiece, XLM-R Unigram; no Microsoft.ML.Tokenizers). Built-in profiles for all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (mean/L2), bge-small-en-v1.5 and bge-base-en-v1.5 (CLS/L2), bge-m3 (CLS/L2, 1024 wide), nomic-embed-text-v1.5 (mean, not normalized), and the rerankers ms-marco-MiniLM-L6-v2 and bge-reranker-v2-m3 (raw logits), through separate typed APIs. Ships the asset locks, not the weights; acquire them explicitly. The application adds the ONNX Runtime native package. Maturity is per model profile (Stable, Preview or Experimental): see the README, generated from the model registry.",
